  "Geometry and legends from the official AG75 top view (81 keys), 42 px keys on a 44 px pitch.",
  "SparkLink V2 38A6:28DE/28DF/28E0/28E1/28F0/28F1/28F2 (official isAG75 list); manual selection (SparkLink publishes no layout token).",
  "Bottom row right of Space: Fn and Ctrl (no right Alt). The switch right of Up is not a key.",
  "Fn uses HallJoy code 0x409 (SparkLink 0xF101)."
 ]
